      "writtenOn": "2024-02-07T02:16:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we don\u0027t support multiple paths, how about the structure like below?\n\n```\npub struct Overlay {\n  pub base_path: Path,\n  pub additional_properties: Vec\u003cProperty\u003e,\n\n}\n\npub struct Property {\n  pub name: CString,\n  pub value: Vec[u8],\n}\n```",
