      "lineNbr": 30,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-08T13:12:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is possible that:\n\n1) `VM_REFERENCE_DT_ON_HOST_PATH` does not exist on host DT (if u-droid vendor partition in not supported) \u0026\u0026 LLPVM in enabled, the `device_tree_overlay` will only contain Nonsecure properties then.\n\n2) It is possible LLPVM feature is not enabled, `VM_REFERENCE_DT_ON_HOST_PATH` exists, in which case `device_tree_overlay` will only contain a copy of  reference DT.\n\n3) Neither to exist, in which case no overlay should be added!\n\nSuch combinations justify the need for `Overlay` to be enum . I get that `Overlay` is a bad name for the enum, let me change that to `DtAddition`.",
      "parentUuid": "795e8dde_f6c7696b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 30,
        "endChar": 23
      },
