      },
      "lineNbr": 33,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-08T13:12:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In cases where `VM_REFERENCE_DT_ON_HOST_PATH` is not present, the final device tree overlay will only contain the nonsecure nodes, so it might be tricky to get WithProp to accept a device tree node.\n\nWe can change it to `WithProp(path, name, value)`, but this generalization would allow adding properties at arbitrary paths. I think it might be more robust restricting additional properties to nonsecure node only?",
