      "writtenOn": "2024-02-07T02:16:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about `AdditionalProp`, since your intent seems to distinguish properties from the path(host DT come from ABL) and props(sk id)?",
      "parentUuid": "eb26dd56_ac286aa1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 35,
