      "lineNbr": 35,
      "author": {
        "id": 1897307
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-09T12:05:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see `nonsecure` is adding more confusion, when it was intended to simplify nomenclature. Let\u0027s rename it to `avf-host-controlled`?\n\n\u003e However, this CL partially breaks that assumption as the guest will now have to distrust a subset of the DT\n\nAs we discussed, we are adding that to the ABI.\n(should be added to /pvmfw/README as well?)",
      "parentUuid": "504f2f23_4698063a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 35,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 35,
        "endChar": 13
      },
      "revId": "08e55ba36305815bb1b0ebe7189f076dd65e3d0a",
